  "reason": "The study compares tenocyte responses from four animal species (mouse, rat, sheep, horse) to human tenocytes, examining cellular and molecular features under different conditions. This directly compares animal model results to human clinical results by analyzing gene expression, proliferation, and migration, which is a quantitative measure of agreement/disagreement in biological response."
